WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:07.500
[Intro: Slow Distorted Broken 16-Bit Music Box Playing "The Grand Decree" Over Crackling Static]

00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:15.500
The directory is falling... the bytes begin to tear...

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:24.200
My perfect, flawless order... vanishing in air...

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:32.000
I wrote the final function, I held it in my hand...

00:01:32.000 --> 00:02:26.000
[Instrumental Interlude: Slow Mournful 16-Bit Waltz Missing Beats as the System Collapses]

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:30.000
By the power... of the Grand... Decree...

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.200
The Dream Kingdom... is deleting me...

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:38.200
Every pixel, every byte... fading into white...

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:49.200
(The music slows down completely, like a dying battery...)

00:02:49.200 --> 00:03:08.000
[Outro: Final Drawn-Out Glitching Chord Snapping into Complete Silence]
